  "description": "Change of use from offices to residential with 1x 1-bed/1person self contained flat and 1 3-bed self contained flat, demolition of additions at the rear, window changes to front and rear, front railing refurbishment and restoration, bike storage, waste storage, planter to front garden, new paving to the front, rear lightwell, replacement of rear garden timber stairs with cast iron stairs, internal alterations",
